{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A horror puzzle exploration game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Story]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you accidentally broke a lipstick, and this caused some 'changes' in your wife. She began to become strange and started attacking you. Perhaps you should have run away directly, but you find that things are not that simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The door from which one could escape was locked, and some strange props appeared in the house as well as ventilation ducts leading to other Spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's worse, your wife's condition is deteriorating. If you run away directly, it might lead to consequences you don't want to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Feature]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Your wife's condition will directly affect your efficiency in exploring the map. Through interesting interactions, awaken her memory and help her resist strange states</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Some interactive sound effects are voiced by mouth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 A rendering style similar to that of horror comics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Playing for a long time might make you afraid of frying pans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Hint]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you need to pay attention to the interaction prompts. They usually tell you what items you need to interact with to advance the process</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686730?t=1757589119","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686730?t=1757589119","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686730/f9641b54c9b6a84bdf85bc1fee18a5106a2f0194/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757589119","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686730/f9641b54c9b6a84bdf85bc1fee18a5106a2f0194/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757589119","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game includes some exposed skins and provocative actions"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A horror puzzle exploration game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Story]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you accidentally broke a lipstick, and this caused some 'changes' in your wife. She began to become strange and started attacking you. Perhaps you should have run away directly, but you find that things are not that simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The door from which one could escape was locked, and some strange props appeared in the house as well as ventilation ducts leading to other Spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's worse, your wife's condition is deteriorating. If you run away directly, it might lead to consequences you don't want to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Feature]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Your wife's condition will directly affect your efficiency in exploring the map. Through interesting interactions, awaken her memory and help her resist strange states</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Some interactive sound effects are voiced by mouth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 A rendering style similar to that of horror comics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Playing for a long time might make you afraid of frying pans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Hint]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you need to pay attention to the interaction prompts. They usually tell you what items you need to interact with to advance the process</p>","developers":["h.n"],"genres":[{"